    5.2 redistribute, publish, sublicense, sell, rent, or otherwise make the
        Software available to any third party, whether modified or unmodified;

    5.3 distribute any derivative work of the Software, or incorporate the
        Software or any substantial portion of it into another product,
        codebase, or service;

    5.4 use the Software, or knowledge of its structure obtained by exercising
        this grant, to develop a competing project-finance model or product;

    5.5 remove, obscure, or alter any copyright, licence, or attribution notice;
        or

    5.6 use the Owner's name, or the "DutchBay" name, to claim endorsement,
        certification, or approval of any Findings, product, or transaction.

    For the avoidance of doubt, nothing in this section restricts anything You
    are entitled to do under applicable mandatory law, including any statutory
    right of fair dealing, fair use, or lawful reverse engineering.


